<i><b>Upgrade Notes</b></i>

* Requires NSP V1.40.0 or newer.

<b>V2.28.0 Release</b>

<i><b>Important Notes</b></i>

<b>Features</b>

* Keypads added to the dash. Different buttons on the same keypad can be used by both the ECU and the Dash at the same time.

* Added channel <b>CAN Port Bus Load</b> for all available CAN ports

* PD16s added to the dash. Different IO on the same PD16 can be used by both the ECU and the Dash at the same time.

* Added support for the MyLaps X2 Racelink flag module. Track flags can be issued to the dash by race control and display in a similiar manner to user alarms.

<b>Fixes</b>

* Fix Haltech TMS not correctly enumerating errors

* Fix Undo and Redo changes not reflected in Virtual Dash

* Fix Help messages in Alarms screen

* Fixed the <b>Injector Pressure Differential</b> not showing negative values properly on the Haltech Dash Protocol.

* Fix Generic CAN Channel unit types not saving correctly

* Fix some gauge <b>Unit Types</b> not changing based on channel values.

* Fix some Dash Channels showing wrong unit type

* Fix <b>Gear Switch Input State</b> flickering when receiving from Haltech ECU over CAN.

* Fix Odometer not working when using <b>Third Party CAN - General Motors E38</b> protocol.

* Fix slow rendering of Circular gauges in Dash when channel max or min value changes

* Fixes Boost Control Output not available for Haltech Protocol

* Fix the following channels displaying incorrectly on Microtech CAN Protocol:
    * Oil Pressure
    * Fuel Pressure
    * Manifold Pressure

